<title>CANADA: UGG details Canada canola supply and dispositions.</title>
<headline>UGG details Canada canola supply and dispositions.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers Ltd on Wednesday issued its supply and disposition estimates for canola in the 1996/97 (Aug/July) crop year.A SUPPLY     96/97 Est.  95/96 Est.  5-yr-avg ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>opn stcks    911	   589	   549</p>
<p>output     4,929	 6,435	 5,458</p>
<p>imports	 50	    98	    63</p>
<p>total:     5,890	 7,123	 6,070</p>
<p>USEA exports    2,350	 2,804	 2,767</p>
<p>seed	    30	    27	    32</p>
<p>human food 2,700	 2,753	 2,241</p>
<p>feed/waste   325	   628	   379</p>
<p>total:     5,405	 6,212	 5,419</p>
<p>CARRYOVER    485	   911	   651</p>
<p>--Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
